{"t": 1794105982.294303, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`: promo codes are now normalised before lookup \u2014 surrounding whitespace stripped, inner spaces removed, and the result upper-cased (`\" autumn24 \"` \u2192 `\"AUTUMN24\"`).\n\nThis addresses Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, 2,940 events on Android 15 / app 8.2), where the Android keyboard adds spaces and lower-cases the input.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
